===Etymology===
From {{der|en|ML.|Lītuānia|alt=Līthuānia|g=f}}, from {{der|en|sla-pro|*Litъva|g=f}}, from {{der|en|olt|Lietuva|g=f}}; compare the Early Modern synonym {{m|en|Lettow}} (from {{noncog|enm|Lettowe}}).

It has been speculated that the name comes from the rivulet [[wikipedia:Lietauka|Lietauka]],<ref>Zigmas Zinkevičius, ''Lietuvos senosios valstybės 40 svarbiausių mįslių'', Vilnius, 2011, p. 111</ref> although archeological evidence does not corroborate this hypothesis.

